WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.155
Meet Byu.

00:00:01.155 --> 00:00:06.978
Bring your own manga and EPUB books, and make a little time for your next story.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.371
Start with your own files.

00:00:10.371 --> 00:00:15.769
Browse the covers on your bookshelf, then choose the book you want to read.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.554
Enjoy your comics one page at a time, or switch to a two-page spread.

00:00:23.554 --> 00:00:26.703
A larger screen gives each panel more room.

00:00:26.703 --> 00:00:29.633
Turn the page and keep the story moving.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.381
Settle into an EPUB book.

00:00:36.381 --> 00:00:43.153
Adjust the text size to find a comfortable view, and enjoy a quiet moment with your story.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:50.901
When you would rather listen, start read aloud for EPUB text.

00:00:50.901 --> 00:00:55.230
Follow the highlighted passage as it moves through the book.

00:00:55.230 --> 00:00:57.828
Voice options depend on your device.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.143
Read your manga.

00:01:06.143 --> 00:01:08.300
Open your EPUB books.

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:11.073
Listen to the next chapter.

00:01:11.073 --> 00:01:13.538
Find Byu on Google Play.
